Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 00:27:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] - wxSmith: Enable direct loading after tree construction.
 Without this, images added after tree construction would be wrong.

git-svn-id: https://svn.code.sf.net/p/codeblocks/code/trunk@13842 2a5c6006-c6dd-42ca-98ab-0921f2732cef
(cherry picked from commit b81412050f5d4ee5f444a8b59ce57ac3e065df89)
---
 .../contrib/wxSmith/wxsresourcetree.cpp       | 29 +++++++++++++++----
 src/plugins/contrib/wxSmith/wxsresourcetree.h |  1 +
 2 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/plugins/contrib/wxSmith/wxsresourcetree.cpp b/src/plugins/contrib/wxSmith/wxsresourcetree.cpp
index 0dee3c38d..21afd4a50 100644
